{"displayStem":"서로 다른 초기 오염량을 가진 금속 시험편에 같은 불활성화 처리를 적용했다. 그래프는 시험편 전체를 회수해 얻은 합성 CFU 기록이며 로그축이다. 집락 회수율과 생존 미생물 종류는 같다고 가정한다.","notes":[{"kind":"provenance","text":"교육 목적으로 구성한 학습자료입니다."},{"kind":"provenance","text":"교육용 합성자료 · 점 사이 직선은 관찰 순서 연결","links":[]}],"evidenceMarkup":["<div class=\"dataset-evidence batch-C01 c01-batch\"><div class=\"evidence\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 800 500\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"교육용 합성자료 비교 그래프\"><rect width=\"800\" height=\"500\" fill=\"white\"></rect><path d=\"M110 100V365H740\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path><path d=\"M110 365v8\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"110\" y=\"405\" font-size=\"28\" style=\"font-size:28px\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text><path d=\"M234 365v8\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"234\" y=\"405\" font-size=\"28\" style=\"font-size:28px\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text><path d=\"M358 365v8\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"358\" y=\"405\" font-size=\"28\" style=\"font-size:28px\" text-anchor=\"middle\">4</text><path d=\"M482 365v8\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"482\" y=\"405\" font-size=\"28\" style=\"font-size:28px\" text-anchor=\"middle\">6</text><path d=\"M606 365v8\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"606\" y=\"405\" font-size=\"28\" style=\"font-size:28px\" text-anchor=\"middle\">8</text><path d=\"M730 365v8\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"730\" y=\"405\" font-size=\"28\" style=\"font-size:28px\" text-anchor=\"middle\">10</text><path d=\"M102 365h8\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"90\" y=\"374\" font-size=\"28\" style=\"font-size:28px\" text-anchor=\"end\">0</text><path d=\"M102 280h8\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"90\" y=\"289\" font-size=\"28\" style=\"font-size:28px\" text-anchor=\"end\">2</text><path d=\"M102 195h8\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"90\" y=\"204\" font-size=\"28\" style=\"font-size:28px\" text-anchor=\"end\">4</text><path d=\"M102 110h8\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"90\" y=\"119\" font-size=\"28\" style=\"font-size:28px\" text-anchor=\"end\">6</text><text x=\"28\" y=\"40\" font-size=\"28\" style=\"font-size:28px\">생존 log10(CFU/시험편)</text><text x=\"420\" y=\"450\" font-size=\"28\" style=\"font-size:28px\" text-anchor=\"middle\">처리 시간 (min)</text><line x1=\"130\" x2=\"185\" y1=\"75\" y2=\"75\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"3\"></line><text x=\"200\" y=\"84\" font-size=\"26\" style=\"font-size:26px\">가</text><polyline points=\"110,110 234,152.5 358,195 482,237.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"3\"></polyline><circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"110\" r=\"4\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"234\" cy=\"152.5\" r=\"4\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"358\" cy=\"195\" r=\"4\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"482\" cy=\"237.5\" r=\"4\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><line x1=\"445\" x2=\"500\" y1=\"75\" y2=\"75\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"9 6\"></line><text x=\"515\" y=\"84\" font-size=\"26\" style=\"font-size:26px\">나</text><polyline points=\"110,195 234,237.5 358,280 482,322.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"9 6\"></polyline><rect x=\"106\" y=\"191\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><rect x=\"230\" y=\"233.5\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><rect x=\"354\" y=\"276\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><rect x=\"478\" y=\"318.5\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></rect></svg></div></div>"]}